Forward a coding request to the user's local Claude Code CLI.

Use this when the user (in EmiCode) asks for code work — feature design,
refactoring, explanation of how something works, or a follow-up to an
in-progress coding-agent conversation. Read-only — the coding agent
runs with Read / Glob / Grep only and cannot edit files; its replies
are proposals the user applies manually.

Multi-turn: session_id is persisted per room. Consecutive calls in the
same EmiCode conversation resume the same coding-agent session via
``claude --resume``, so the agent doesn't re-read the codebase from
scratch on every turn.
